{
    "title": "Shipt Snack & Grocery Delivery",
    "description": "Order same day delivery on groceries, food, snacks, alcohol* and more with Shipt! \r\n\r\nShipt is the grocery and food delivery app committed to providing exceptional service, fresh groceries, food, produce & more with personal shoppers you can trust. Easily order groceries, snacks, household essentials, fresh food, pet supplies, alcohol* & more! Get same-day delivery from your favorite stores with Shipt, our grocery & fresh food delivery service.  \r\n\r\nOn Shipt, select your favorite grocery store and easily order delivery on food, snacks, groceries, pet supplies, beauty products & more! Choose a delivery time that best fits your schedule \u2013 then relax and wait for your grocery delivery while our personal shoppers work their magic so you can have more time to do the things you love. \r\n\r\nThe Food, Snack & Grocery Delivery App \r\n- Get your groceries, food, and other items delivered by a personal shopper with same-day delivery service with Shipt. \r\n- Your personal shopper ensures your grocery delivery is as convenient as possible, saving you time and money. \r\n- Easily adjust grocery or food orders as long as our shoppers are still in the aisle at your favorite grocery store \r\n- Save money with Shipt and discover this week's latest deals \r\n\r\nShipt is the Trusted & Convenient Grocery Delivery Service  \r\n- Get same-day grocery delivery and personal shoppers that are available to 80% of households in over 5,000 US cities. \r\n- When you order fresh food, groceries, or other items, your shopper communicates in real-time about food preferences & grocery substitutions.  \r\n- Schedule same-day grocery delivery, pay, and tip \u2013 all in the Shipt app  \r\n- Order delivery on groceries, food, or snacks with go-to grocery lists & favorite items, from breakfast to dessert.  \r\n- On average, customers save 8 hours a month on grocery shopping, using Shipt delivery. \r\n\r\nSame Day Delivery from Top Grocery Stores & Restaurants \r\n- Same day delivery on items from a variety of stores and product categories \r\n- Snack delivery: Ensure you are always prepared for game day.  \r\n- Grocery Delivery: Get exactly what you need, from perfectly ripe avocados to freckled bananas. \r\n- Food Delivery: Save time and order dinner for the entire family from home, the office or the road. \r\n- Household essentials delivered with Shipt! Get wellness products, pet supplies, & more!  \r\n- Retail partners include CVS, Harris Teeter, Publix, H-E-B, Meijer, Petco, Target, and more.  \r\n\r\nShipt Also Offers: \r\n- Get access to exclusive savings, coupons, and sale alerts on the items you love to order. \r\n- Reorder products from your past purchases for added convenience. \r\n- Favorite items to save time when you shop.  \r\n- Leave notes on items to get exactly what you need, and how you want it.  \r\n- Message your shopper to add special requests to your order.  \r\n- Discover curated seasonal products from beauty, home, entertaining, groceries, and food. \r\n- SNAP EBT is now accepted! Pay for your grocery delivery order with SNAP EBT \r\n\r\nWe\u2019re just as choosy with our shoppers as they are with your produce. That\u2019s why you can always expect friendly service and fresh produce with every Shipt order. Don\u2019t just take our word for it, try it for yourself and find out what 56 million 5-star reviews are saying.  \r\n\r\n\"This has been an absolute blessing. It\u2019s super reasonably priced, convenient, and reliable! I highly recommend it!\" \u2013 Harvey, \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n\r\n\"I LOVE this app! It\u2019s easy to use and communication with the shoppers is a breeze. Truly life changing!\" \u2013 Misty, \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n\r\nDelivery from your favorite local grocery stores and food places are only a few taps away \u2013 download the Shipt app, start your order, and we\u2019ll take care of the rest. For more information, visit shipt.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Order same day delivery on groceries, food, snacks, alcohol* and more with Shipt! <br><br>Shipt is the grocery and food delivery app committed to providing exceptional service, fresh groceries, food, produce &amp; more with personal shoppers you can trust. Easily order groceries, snacks, household essentials, fresh food, pet supplies, alcohol* &amp; more! Get same-day delivery from your favorite stores with Shipt, our grocery &amp; fresh food delivery service.  <br><br>On Shipt, select your favorite grocery store and easily order delivery on food, snacks, groceries, pet supplies, beauty products &amp; more! Choose a delivery time that best fits your schedule \u2013 then relax and wait for your grocery delivery while our personal shoppers work their magic so you can have more time to do the things you love. <br><br>The Food, Snack &amp; Grocery Delivery App <br>- Get your groceries, food, and other items delivered by a personal shopper with same-day delivery service with Shipt. <br>- Your personal shopper ensures your grocery delivery is as convenient as possible, saving you time and money. <br>- Easily adjust grocery or food orders as long as our shoppers are still in the aisle at your favorite grocery store <br>- Save money with Shipt and discover this week&#39;s latest deals <br><br>Shipt is the Trusted &amp; Convenient Grocery Delivery Service  <br>- Get same-day grocery delivery and personal shoppers that are available to 80% of households in over 5,000 US cities. <br>- When you order fresh food, groceries, or other items, your shopper communicates in real-time about food preferences &amp; grocery substitutions.  <br>- Schedule same-day grocery delivery, pay, and tip \u2013 all in the Shipt app  <br>- Order delivery on groceries, food, or snacks with go-to grocery lists &amp; favorite items, from breakfast to dessert.  <br>- On average, customers save 8 hours a month on grocery shopping, using Shipt delivery. <br><br>Same Day Delivery from Top Grocery Stores &amp; Restaurants <br>- Same day delivery on items from a variety of stores and product categories <br>- Snack delivery: Ensure you are always prepared for game day.  <br>- Grocery Delivery: Get exactly what you need, from perfectly ripe avocados to freckled bananas. <br>- Food Delivery: Save time and order dinner for the entire family from home, the office or the road. <br>- Household essentials delivered with Shipt! Get wellness products, pet supplies, &amp; more!  <br>- Retail partners include CVS, Harris Teeter, Publix, H-E-B, Meijer, Petco, Target, and more.  <br><br>Shipt Also Offers: <br>- Get access to exclusive savings, coupons, and sale alerts on the items you love to order. <br>- Reorder products from your past purchases for added convenience. <br>- Favorite items to save time when you shop.  <br>- Leave notes on items to get exactly what you need, and how you want it.  <br>- Message your shopper to add special requests to your order.  <br>- Discover curated seasonal products from beauty, home, entertaining, groceries, and food. <br>- SNAP EBT is now accepted! Pay for your grocery delivery order with SNAP EBT <br><br>We\u2019re just as choosy with our shoppers as they are with your produce. That\u2019s why you can always expect friendly service and fresh produce with every Shipt order. Don\u2019t just take our word for it, try it for yourself and find out what 56 million 5-star reviews are saying.  <br><br>&quot;This has been an absolute blessing. It\u2019s super reasonably priced, convenient, and reliable! I highly recommend it!&quot; \u2013 Harvey, \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 <br><br>&quot;I LOVE this app! It\u2019s easy to use and communication with the shoppers is a breeze. Truly life changing!&quot; \u2013 Misty, \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 <br><br>Delivery from your favorite local grocery stores and food places are only a few taps away \u2013 download the Shipt app, start your order, and we\u2019ll take care of the rest. For more information, visit shipt.com.",
